    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "An unprecedented deluge from one of the heaviest rainy seasons in three decades caused reservoirs to overflow, leading to widespread inundation across the Syrian regions. The surging flows flooded homes, farms, and schools in Deir Ezzor and Raqqa, resulting in a devastating drowning incident where young lives were lost. Rescue teams mobilized for emergency response as communities and shelters were inundated, leaving a critical access point lost when an earthen bridge collapsed.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [
        "how_fragments_expanded_to_contiguous_span"
      ],
      "fit": 0.95
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Following severe weather, an extreme weather event caused infrastructure to be pushed to its breaking point. This led to a flood causation scenario where defenses were breached, resulting in a flooding event with significant property damage. The resulting fatalities among minors prompted international cooperation to protect downstream communities, with a water management agreement reached to mitigate the disaster outcome.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0",
          "result-4"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "A climatic anomaly caused embankment failure and a bridge collapse, severing a vital link. Leadership presence at the scene of suffering underscored the disaster impact, as evacuation operations were launched to address the widespread material damage. This diplomatic agreement represents a cooperation measure to ease pressure and aid the affected minors in the wake of the tragedy.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
